    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>小紧：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>感谢你带给我年轻的生命力和爱的能量，</span></p><span></span><p><span>让巴厘岛的美好瞬间，就停留在那里。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>qq：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2025 年的首更，为大家献上一期充满爱与泡泡的高甜播客！</span></p><span></span><p><span>强烈建议各位都来听听，男女老少皆宜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时祝大家新的一年也能感受到爱的能量，无论是以何种形式发生在何处。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间码：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">1:25</a> 开屏暴击，一切的「始作俑者」，hqq！(写 shownotes 的 qq 再次道歉，对不起！)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 与巴厘岛包车司机畅谈，让我对「男性的爱」有了新的认识。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 算命的说我心轮堵塞 (chakra)，不信任男的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1247">20:47</a> 今日主菜：在苍古酒吧，艳遇法国小哥。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 小紧道：The best boy I've ever met. qq 问：他 best 在哪儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">38:21</a> 与法国小哥惊喜重逢，结果差点弄丢手机……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a> 如何告别的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3172">52:52</a> 从他身上感受到强烈的、年轻的生命力和爱的能量。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> He is a good kisser. (qq 尖叫)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3587">59:47</a> 拒绝 x 关系？不是理性脑太强大，而是我需要诚实面对自己的心。</span></p>]]></description>
